# Week 5 enumeration lab: simulated SNMP agent (community name = filename).
# File MUST be named public.snmprec so snmpsim serves it under community "public".
# Walk it with:  snmpwalk -v2c -c public 172.22.0.14
# Format: <OID>|<BER tag>|<value>   (tag 4=OctetString, 2=Integer32, 6=OID,
#         64x=IpAddress hex, 65=Counter32, 66=Gauge32, 67=TimeTicks)
# This models a Cisco-style edge router "enum-edge-router-01".

# ---- system group (RFC1213-MIB / SNMPv2-MIB) --------------------------------
1.3.6.1.2.1.1.1.0|4|Cisco IOS Software, ENUM-2901 Software (15.7(3)M3), RELEASE SOFTWARE (fc2). Technical Support: http://www.cisco.com/techsupport. Copyright (c) 1986-2018 by Cisco Systems, Inc. Compiled Mon 30-Jul-18 09:15 by mcpre
